      "role": "user",
      "content": "gotcha. so it's more of a professional service. id just be extra nervous about someone else having control over my life savings for a few weeks lol. what exactly keeps them from just... vanishing with the money or something? like what's the actual safeguard in place?",
      "source": "evaluator"
